on and inform clinical interpretation. Moreover, this work facilitates investigation of FPDMM pathogenesis and supports refinement of RUNX1-specific variant curation guidelines. We further advocate for development of additional functional assays, especially for variants affecting the RUNX1 C-terminus.\n\n"
